OL,3,GNEWSARescued hospital temporarily shuts
OL,4,Afor heating works
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital saved from closure has
OL,7,Ftemporarily shut its doors to install a
OL,8,Fnew heating system.
OL,10,FServices at Bishop's Castle Community
OL,11,FHospital in Shropshire were saved in
OL,12,F2024 after a temporary closure
OL,13,Fannounced in 2021 looked set to become
OL,14,Fpermanent due to a lack of nurses.
OL,16,FThe hospital is now temporarily closed
OL,17,Ffor a short period - expected to be up
OL,18,Fto three weeks - while work is carried
OL,19,Fout to address the issues affecting its
OL,20,Fheating system.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
