OL,3,GNEWSARescued hospital temporarily shuts
OL,4,Afor heating works
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We understand how important Bishop's
OL,7,FCastle Community Hospital is to local
OL,8,Fpeople and recognise the uncertainty
OL,9,Fthis temporary closure may cause," the
OL,10,Fhospital said.
